{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve the existing plugin dispatch-order contract.** Public configuration and `PluginRunner` documentation previously promised hooks in registration order. Reversing only `onInvocationEnd` changes observable behavior for existing multi-plugin configurations. Keep legacy ordering, or introduce an opt-in scoped-cleanup mechanism whose participating resources explicitly unwind in reverse.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77KTNH","finding_digest":"228b02e451d041f1350baeb06c1087e868a78673c95bfbe462221502988bf67c","finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":110,"observation_digest":"c78974e3c080ab0cedb32a87e674809884c7119ce0d70f4b639c186abb3ac56c","observation_id":"aro_v1_y6exjy6aqcvqz3ntfkd6m5eatc","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","published_at":"2026-10-08T01:44:36Z","review_id":"arr_v1_mb43dz4wvue7ua4shmyofxjani","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"7ce02425b0b1fb16535b763af5965d08fbe49592","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_6flbqepcozkr3wkxtbj6ebdqtx","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T01:44:36Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
